### Component 3: Backend Python ML & Sub-Window Analytics (`backend/services/ml_inference/`)

#### [NEW] [roi_analyzer.py](file:///c:/Users/krish/Desktop/SatVistaar/backend/services/ml_inference/roi_analyzer.py)
- Specializes in sub-window and masked polygon raster analytics:
  - Computes exact pixel statistics inside the ROI mask:
    - Optical NDVI / greenness distribution -> Vegetation percentage & area
    - SAR backscatter intensity (dB proxy) + optical edge contrast -> Built-up percentage & area
    - Water spectral absorption & SAR specular reflection (<70 dB) -> Water percentage & area
    - Remaining reflectance -> Bare soil & other
  - Modality comparison within ROI (Optical vs SAR) for Fusion tasks.
  - Pixel difference & contour analysis within ROI for Bi-Temporal change.
  - Bounding box intersection & clipping for Grounding tasks.
  - Synthesizes grounded natural-language findings tailored to the user's specific ROI query.

